WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:16.710
It was the first hot day of spring.

2
00:00:16.711 --> 00:00:24.961
Bobby was sweating as he walked to Kids Central.

3
00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:28.027
Nina and Izzie had paper fans.

4
00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:31.700
They waved them in front of each other.

5
00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:35.765
"What are we doing today?" Bobby asked Miss Shelly.

6
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:39.224
"Please, can we go outside?"

7
00:00:39.225 --> 00:00:42.268
"I wouldn't keep you inside on such a hot day."

8
00:00:42.269 --> 00:00:44.586
Miss Shelly smiled.

9
00:00:44.587 --> 00:00:49.112
"Grab a water bottle, and follow me!"

10
00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:53.562
The kids followed Miss Shelly out to the soccer field.

11
00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:58.989
"Today we're going to play squirt freeze tag," she said.

12
00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:04.555
"Squirt freeze tag?" Izzie repeated. "What's that?"

13
00:01:04.556 --> 00:01:08.555
"One person will be 'it,'" Miss Shelly began.

14
00:01:08.556 --> 00:01:12.204
"Whoever is 'it' must tag everyone else.

15
00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:15.696
You tag someone by squirting them with water.

16
00:01:15.697 --> 00:01:18.946
If you are tagged, you cannot move!

17
00:01:18.947 --> 00:01:21.564
You must freeze!

18
00:01:21.565 --> 00:01:25.294
After everyone is tagged, we'll choose another 'it.'"

19
00:01:25.295 --> 00:01:29.615
Miss Shelly looked at everyone. "Understand?"

20
00:01:29.616 --> 00:01:31.473
The kids nodded.

21
00:01:31.474 --> 00:01:34.846
"Who gets to be 'it' first?" Ethan asked.

22
00:01:34.847 --> 00:01:36.930
Miss Shelly grinned.

23
00:01:36.931 --> 00:01:41.757
"I'm thinking of a number between one and twenty," she said.

24
00:01:41.758 --> 00:01:44.287
"Guess what number it is."

25
00:01:44.288 --> 00:01:47.697
"Eleven!" Bobby called out.

26
00:01:47.698 --> 00:01:50.396
"Six," said Jason.

27
00:01:50.397 --> 00:01:53.306
"Fifteen," guessed Izzie.

28
00:01:53.307 --> 00:01:56.017
"Nineteen," Ethan said.

29
00:01:56.018 --> 00:01:58.934
"Ten," guessed Nina.

30
00:01:58.935 --> 00:02:01.986
"It was eleven," Miss Shelly said.

31
00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:04.169
"Bobby, you're 'it!'"

32
00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.874
"Woo-hoo!" Bobby cheered.

33
00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:09.904
Everyone else put down their water bottles.

34
00:02:09.905 --> 00:02:12.913
"We'll start by standing in a circle.

35
00:02:12.914 --> 00:02:16.554
Bobby, you stand in the middle."

36
00:02:16.555 --> 00:02:22.774
Miss Shelly stood outside the circle.

37
00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:27.008
"On your mark, get set, go!"

38
00:02:27.009 --> 00:02:29.554
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

39
00:02:29.555 --> 00:02:32.033
Bobby chased after Ethan.

40
00:02:32.034 --> 00:02:34.404
But Ethan was fast!

41
00:02:34.405 --> 00:02:37.480
Bobby decided to try to catch him later.

42
00:02:37.481 --> 00:02:42.214
He turned around and spotted Nina.

43
00:02:42.215 --> 00:02:48.025
He sprinted toward her.

44
00:02:48.026 --> 00:02:53.299
"Eek!" Nina squealed as she got squirted with water.

45
00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:57.968
"You have to freeze!" Izzie reminded her, running by.

46
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:00.607
Now Bobby was after Izzie.

47
00:03:00.608 --> 00:03:02.433
He raised his water bottle . . .

48
00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:06.026
Squirt! Izzie was frozen.

49
00:03:06.027 --> 00:03:09.157
Water dripped down her forehead.

50
00:03:09.158 --> 00:03:11.597
Bobby ran after Jason.

51
00:03:11.598 --> 00:03:14.438
Jason looked hot and tired.

52
00:03:14.439 --> 00:03:18.599
"Here's some water to cool you off!" Bobby shouted.

53
00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.367
He squirted his friend in the back.

54
00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:26.838
"Ha-ha! That's cold water!" Jason giggled and then froze.

55
00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:30.618
"Bet you can't catch me!" Ethan cried.

56
00:03:30.619 --> 00:03:33.288
He ran across the soccer field.

57
00:03:33.289 --> 00:03:36.726
Bobby raced after him.

58
00:03:36.727 --> 00:03:40.784
Ethan ran one way and then the other.

59
00:03:40.785 --> 00:03:44.253
Once, Bobby got close enough to squirt.

60
00:03:44.254 --> 00:03:48.086
But Ethan ducked out of the way!

61
00:03:48.087 --> 00:03:52.178
"Ahhh!" Bobby got a burst of energy.

62
00:03:52.179 --> 00:03:54.635
He ran as fast as he could.

63
00:03:54.636 --> 00:03:58.746
Ethan stumbled! Squirt!

64
00:03:58.747 --> 00:04:03.690
Water dripped down Ethan's back.

65
00:04:03.691 --> 00:04:07.730
"You're all frozen!" Bobby shouted happily.

66
00:04:07.731 --> 00:04:11.891
"Game over!" Miss Shelly called.

67
00:04:11.892 --> 00:04:14.783
Bobby was hot and breathing hard.

68
00:04:14.784 --> 00:04:18.059
"That was fun!" Nina said.

69
00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.553
"Let's play again!" Ethan looked at Miss Shelly.

70
00:04:21.554 --> 00:04:24.384
"Sure," Miss Shelly said.

71
00:04:24.385 --> 00:04:28.464
"Bobby, please pick our next 'it.'"

72
00:04:28.465 --> 00:04:34.615
"Okay. I'm thinking of a number between one and twenty," Bobby said.

73
00:04:34.616 --> 00:04:39.778
He smiled. Usually he didn't like getting caught in a game of tag.

74
00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:48.085
But it would feel great to get squirted with water now!
